# Nous gateway model providers. deploy.sh copies this to docker/env/.env.gateway.
# hermes-agent does not load that file. Uncomment a line only after you have the key.
# An empty value is passed into the container and hides the same name in /opt/data/.env.
# COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN accepts gho_, github_pat_, or ghu_. A classic ghp_ token does not work.
# A fine-grained token needs the Account permission Copilot Requests on your personal account.
# GITHUB_COPILOT_TOKEN is read only when COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN is unset.
# A new Google AI Studio key starts with AQ. GEMINI_API_KEY is read only when GOOGLE_API_KEY is unset.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN=
# GITHUB_COPILOT_TOKEN=
